WEBVTT

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:32.550
It's cold.

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:45.940
Today's lucky sign is Aquarius.

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:49.270
Your hard-work pays,
and you'll make good progress.

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:52.530
Pisces can expect some improvement
in their surroundings.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:55.150
It's time to ask your parents for
something while you can.

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:56.860
It's been a long time since I saw this last.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:59.950
Aries can't quite make your dream come true
yet. You better not push yourself too hard.

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:59.950
I didn't get up this early back home.

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:05.750
I always missed the horoscope
part while getting ready.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:03.370
Today's Horoscope

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:03.540
Taurus should watch out for bad spending.
Don't waste your money.

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:09.540
Cancer should pay close attention to their
surroundings, and don't forget to smile.

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:20.510
Today's Horoscope
Sagittarius
Bad

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:22.270
Relax and take a deep breath.

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:25.350
Oh no, I missed it again.

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:25.350
Well, take care. Have a nice day.

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:33.440
Morning!

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:37.910
Hi, Miya, good morning.
Come in, it's cold out there.

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:39.570
Thanks.

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:41.030
Hi

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:45.710
It's showing a snowman symbol.
It might snow today.

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:47.080
Really?

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:52.460
That new cell phone looks cool.

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:54.630
Miya, are you thinking of buying a new one?

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:57.840
Nope, but if someone gave me
one for free, I'd take it.

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:03.930
The world is so big. There must be
someone who'd buy me anything I want.

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:06.060
Miya, we're going.

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:08.850
Hey, Yunocchi, wait.

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:25.750
Tell me, tell me, what color is in season now?

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:27.000
Smiling white

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.460
Tearful blue

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:31.080
Let's mix them together and find out

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:36.420
Today is sunny, so take out your canvas

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:39.130
Have some ice cream and lemon soda

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:41.840
Then draw some exciting and colorful toppings

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:45.850
Hey, rough sketch, please

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:51.770
Let's do a self portrait contest

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:54.520
Yuno

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:58.990
All right. Don't get grouchy later

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:57.780
Miyako

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:00.280
Hiro

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:06.120
When the switch is flipped, I go wa-ha-ha

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.530
Sae

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:12.460
I hope everyone is having a great time

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:14.000
The race is on

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.800
I've gotta finish my apple quickly

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:19.380
No, that's not for eating

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:23.050
Let's take it easy

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:28.020
Fruits are our display models

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:32.850
So start drawing

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:35.690
It's our homework

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:43.360
January 11th - A Winter's Collage

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:45.650
So cold...

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:50.280
When we made these,
the cicadas were singing in a choir.

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:51.490
<i>Hi</i>

00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:51.990
<i>Da</i>

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:52.490
<i>Ma</i>

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:52.990
<i>Ri</i>

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:53.450
<i>Apartments</i>

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:56.570
Remember, everyone at your place?

00:03:56.990 --> 00:04:00.540
Yeah, I do, that was fun.

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:03.120
Morning.

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:06.880
Hiro, good morning.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:10.460
Morning.

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:12.550
Sae, good morning.

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:16.680
I'll say it again, Happy New Year.

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:20.220
Miya, I've heard that more than ten times.

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:22.810
I did too, like at the shrine yesterday.

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:26.400
Good thing it wasn't crowded. We were able
to make a wish without any trouble.

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:30.900
Everyone was dressed casually,
but Ms. Yoshinoya wore a kimono.

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:33.360
After all, she's a cosplay queen.

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:35.860
But she got ''tough luck" on her fortune.

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:39.370
She even tried to tie the tag in her mouth.

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:42.410
You got a great luck one, right, Yunocchi?

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:47.080
You'd better not drop your guard though.
Remember, ''Happiness attracts problems.''

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:53.630
We've gotta hurry.

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:58.010
See you at noon.

00:04:58.010 --> 00:04:59.470
Okay.

00:04:59.470 --> 00:05:02.010
Oh, I just remembered. The next drawing
class will be a different room.

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:03.520
Really?

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:06.150
Yunocchi, did you do your homework?

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:07.200
Homework?

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:11.030
Art Department 1-A

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:17.920
Good morning, class.
Did you enjoy the winter break?

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:22.040
I had a wonderful winter break.

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:24.880
I had a long chat with a friend on the phone...

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:26.590
Went to karaoke...

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:31.300
Wore a pretty kimono and visited the
shrine on New Year's Day...

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:35.560
Ran away from my niece and nephew for
demanding a New Year allowance...

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:43.110
See? I'm still young enough that I should be
receiving some too, don't you think?

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:48.490
<i>Please focus and do your best, all right?</i>

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:47.650
I don't know what to do with the homework.

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:48.490
What's wrong? It's so strange that
you'd forget something like that.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:50.200
What's wrong? It's so strange that
you'd forget something like that.
<i>Make sure you turn in your homework by
the homeroom at the end of the day.</i>

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.030
<i>Make sure you turn in your homework by
the homeroom at the end of the day.</i>

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:53.240
How did I forget it?
<i>Make sure you turn in your homework by
the homeroom at the end of the day.</i>

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:56.290
There's no way I can finish it.

00:05:56.450 --> 00:06:01.500
You can turn it in late.
Remember you should have excellent luck?

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:07.720
Love: You'll meet a dreamy person.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:08.970
Money: Sell and make profit.

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:10.260
We won.

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:10.260
Lawsuit: You'll win.

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:15.810
On to today's assignment.

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:20.810
What should I do?

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.270
Layout planes

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.270
Vertical and horizontal perspectives

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.270
Find mistakes

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:30.700
All right, that's it for today.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:40.710
Ms. Yoshinoya...

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:44.540
Oh, Yuno, what's wrong?

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:48.880
I'm afraid I couldn't finish
my homework in time.

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:51.840
I'll make sure I finish it by the first lab,

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.550
so will you still accept it?

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:56.310
Oh my...

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:00.430
Sorry.

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:03.770
We lost...

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:10.280
Is this what ''Happiness attracts
problems" means?

00:07:11.900 --> 00:07:13.780
Art Department 1-A

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:19.660
Finally, it's noon. Yunocchi, let's go eat.

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:25.290
I've gotta go get something.
Miya, go ahead to the cafeteria.

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:27.250
Yunocchi?

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:29.300
<i>Hidamari Apartments</i>

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:50.190
Wow, already?

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:55.570
Maybe it's too drab?

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.580
When did she send me these?

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:07.460
Happy New Year, kindest regards.
Cheering self.

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:08.790
How cute.

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:11.550
I can use this.

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:15.970
Now, can I make a copy in time?

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:25.980
Oh no, only two minutes to go.

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:30.610
Yunocchi, go for it. Hurray, Yunocchi.

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:32.230
That Miya...

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:34.320
The goal is right there.

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:36.490
You're embarrassing me.

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:47.790
Snow...

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:55.340
Okay, that will end homeroom.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:09:01.060
The snow is getting thick,
so watch your step while going home.

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:02.430
Remember, try not to catch a cold.

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:05.180
Ms. Yoshinoya...

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:06.310
Yes?

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:09.940
Sorry for taking so long,
but here's my homework.

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:15.740
Okay, it's accepted.

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:26.370
Was it your homework?
Good thing, you made it.

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:30.040
Yeah, I went home and rushed to finish it.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:31.170
During the lunch break?

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:32.460
Yeah.

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:35.670
I'm starving.

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.130
Here's your reward.

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:42.720
When'd you get this?

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:45.560
It's from Hiro. She's on a diet.

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:52.230
Actually, she was worried because you
didn't come back. She saved it for you.

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:54.320
I see.

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:57.650
Hey, we are on cleaning duty,
so hurry and eat up.

00:09:57.900 --> 00:09:58.900
Okay.

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:07.410
Let's finish cleaning and
have a snowball fight.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:14.880
Wow. It's already this deep.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:18.550
Hey, no one has walked on it. It's all mine.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:20.010
Hi, Yuno.

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.720
Hiro, Sae.

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:23.760
Hello.

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:28.350
I heard that you were on cleaning duty,
so I thought you'd be here. Do you need help?

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:32.730
Thanks, but I'll take care of it.

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:40.360
Miya, what are you doing?

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:43.070
Working on art.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.030
Nice idea.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:46.370
What?

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:49.250
See you later, Yuno.

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:55.040
Miya, I didn't say thanks.

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:58.260
Don't come near just yet.

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:00.380
Done.

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:04.640
I just finished my first artwork of the year.

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:11.560
''Love and Peace", huh? That's so Miyako.

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:17.900
P-I-E-C-E... Piece?.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:28.080
I wonder when they'll come back?

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:30.830
They must be absorbed in
playing in the snow.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.870
Wasn't it nice to be that young?

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:36.630
We used to be happy to see the snow
when we were little, weren't we?

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:40.340
Absolutely, ignoring studying and what not.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:41.760
What did you do?

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:46.140
Same as Yuno, like making a snowman
and having a snowball fight.

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:47.800
Oh, and sleighing too.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:51.390
Nothing unusual, huh? That's a surprise.

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:54.770
You sound like I'm some kind of a weirdo.

00:11:54.770 --> 00:12:00.110
No, I wondered if you were
level-headed like you are now.

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:05.610
Am I level-headed? What about you, Hiro?

00:12:05.610 --> 00:12:09.700
I liked snow, but didn't like to get wet.

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:13.040
You know that my moistened hair
will eventually explode.

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:15.920
But you still enjoy playing in the snow, right?

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:22.170
Now I like to stay warm under a
kotatsu table. Don't you, Sae?

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:25.010
More or less, I guess I'm getting old.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:28.220
Hot, tasty tea is the best.

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:38.650
<i>Hidamari Apartments</i>

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:45.400
I'm gonna say thanks to Hiro for the rice ball.

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:46.860
I'll go with you, then.

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:49.410
What's on your mind?

00:12:49.570 --> 00:12:55.500
Well, I thought it'd be great to have hot tea,
a kotatsu table, snacks and mandarins.

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:06.930
Hello, we're here for New Year greetings.

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.140
Miya, that's the eleventh time.

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:13.180
I appreciate what you did earlier.
I wanted to say thanks.

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:16.810
You just came back? It must be cold outside.
Would you like some hot tea?

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:20.060
We were just talking about you two.

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:21.820
Sure.

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:24.150
Thanks for letting us come in.

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:28.780
It's so warm.

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:30.660
Hey.

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:41.500
You have homework today?

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:42.630
Homework?

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:46.760
You're also taking Ms. Yoshinoya's class,
right? Isn't this a collage assignment?

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:52.390
Ah, I see. You did your homework during
the lunch break, didn't you?

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:55.430
How did you know that?

00:13:55.640 --> 00:14:00.270
A logical deduction. And you were
able to submit it in time, right?

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:02.520
Y-Yes.

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:06.110
If not, you wouldn't have played in snow.

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:09.320
You're observant as always, Sae.

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:12.120
Miya, you're like a cat.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:13.530
Meow...

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.120
Isn't it too hot?

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:18.120
Hey, don't push.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:21.750
I'm warming the icy cold body and soul.

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.420
Sae, when did you take this?

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:31.590
So, why does it say ''piece?''

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:33.300
Wha?.

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:37.140
See, it says ''piece.''

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:49.610
I meant to share pieces of my abundant love
with people all over the world...

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:51.200
You just screwed up.

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:55.910
Well, I was testing how many would
actually notice the mistake.

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:58.290
That's totally different from what you just said.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:00.620
I didn't notice.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:04.000
Miya, you aren't good at English, are you?

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:13.180
Here's another one. Miya's rabbit is brownish.

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:16.430
I tried making it so hard that I didn't
notice there was dirt in it.

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:18.640
I see. Is that a hare?

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.270
No!!

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.860
Miya, what are these?

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:27.940
Oh, they're moai statues.

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.990
Moai? They look like some kind of stool.

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:33.860
Hiro, check this out.

00:15:33.860 --> 00:15:36.200
Oh I was looking at their back.

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:39.740
They have a trash bin inside.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:45.380
By the way, that's the snowman I made.

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:48.920
Pretty good, no wonder you
came home so late.

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:52.300
We were so absorbed.

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:54.470
Where did you take those pictures from?

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:57.140
From the corridor on the second floor.

00:15:57.140 --> 00:15:59.720
I couldn't stop because those
scenes were just perfect.

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:04.020
I left earlier, but Sae kept taking photos.

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:06.730
Oh snap, I was spied on.

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:10.900
For the modelling fees, I demand tea,
mandarines and crackers.

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:12.280
Maybe some rice cakes, too.

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:16.360
All right, I'll get you some tea, so go
ahead and eat those on the table.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:21.120
I was able to collect some interesting
material thanks to you.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:25.920
Now I just have to make a collage and
turn it in by tomorrow's lab class.

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:28.080
I see.

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:30.420
You're cutting it close, Sae.

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:34.590
All is well as long as you meet the deadline.
So, what did you make, Yuno?

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:38.390
Um... A mail?

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:41.640
Ms. Yoshinoya

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:41.640
Yuno, I saw your homework.

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:40.970
From Ms. Yoshinoya?

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:42.810
Here's your tea.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.770
Ah, thanks.

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:47.520
''Yuno, I looked at your assignment.''

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:50.230
''Despite being an off-the-cuff work,
it shows your talent,''

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:54.070
''especially where you used the
New Year cards.''

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:56.490
''The source material was good.''

00:16:57.610 --> 00:16:59.280
Only the source material?

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:01.330
What? What did you use?

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:07.670
I used a copy of Ms. Yoshinoya's
greeting card here.

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:09.580
Like this?

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:12.460
Yes, something like that.
But her pose was different.

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:17.470
It was like this on my card. I'll go get one.

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:19.140
I'll get mine, too.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:27.600
No way.

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:29.190
How did I know?.

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:33.070
You normally don't go this far.
Her dedication to cosplay is amazing.

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:36.530
I wonder how many variations she has?

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:39.200
As many as the number of
students in the class, maybe?

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:40.990
I feel like collecting them all.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.160
Is that her intent?

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:45.790
The scary part is that I can't deny that.

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:50.130
So, what about the other greeting card?

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:53.170
It's cheerful...

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:55.130
Another mail from Ms. Yoshinoya?

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:03.010
''Did you receive my New Year card?
I had the first dream of the year.''

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:05.060
Where is it from?

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:19.950
Well, I'd better keep working on this.
Hiro, thank you for the tea.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.370
I'd better go, too.

00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:25.990
Thank you so much for the rice ball.

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:28.250
It tasted great.

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:30.420
But did you eat?

00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:31.750
Oh, it's okay.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:35.050
Right, she ate too many
rice cakes back home.

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:37.960
Stop, don't say that over and over.

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:43.720
I've got to go on a diet, starting today.
I must do it.

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:46.060
I'll take any left-overs.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:47.430
Miya.

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:49.890
You said that earlier today.

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:53.150
Right, Hiro didn't eat a rice ball.

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:58.990
We went to the cafeteria while you
were working on your homework.

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:02.660
We thought you forgot to bring something.

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:06.330
I'll take a cutlet curry rice, super size.

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:11.790
I ordered a kitsune udon,
and Hiro took two rice balls.

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:17.210
Then Hiro jabbed Miyako for having
a high calorie lunch again.

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:23.180
But Miya looked at my lunch,
and teased me for eating light.

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:26.430
I ate too many rice cakes during
the New Year break.

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:28.010
At your parents place?

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:31.690
It's amazing to go home. You just have to sit,
and the food will be served.

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:36.310
That's it. That's the problem. You don't have
to work, so I don't burn any calories.

00:19:36.310 --> 00:19:40.610
Rice cake is so tempting because it's so
soft and taffy like. Are you listening?

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:41.820
Okay, okay.

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:46.120
Jeez, it's too scary to even ask you
how much you have gained.

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:47.950
You just did.

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:51.960
So, I'm on a diet.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:54.710
Now back to the beginning
of the conversation.

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:59.710
That's why Hiro didn't eat one rice ball,

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:04.340
and I spared it, because I thought
you'd miss your lunch.

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:08.010
I see, thank you very much, Hiro.

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:12.930
Yunocchi, don't be tricked.
Hiro did that for her own diet.

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:14.140
No, I didn't.

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:18.480
If you have extra food, please, donate to me.

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:20.400
Is that what you wanted today all along?

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:28.030
Hiro is kind, so you didn't want me
to be too thankful, right?

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:31.240
Oh, you're such a wonderful girl, Yuno.

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:33.750
No, I'm just...

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:39.960
Oh no, I'm not that kind of a person.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:43.880
It's okay, you're wonderful just as you are.

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:45.840
Oh please, Hiro.

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:49.180
Oh. It stopped snowing.

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:52.350
Maybe I should go to
Berry Mart before it starts snowing again.

00:20:52.970 --> 00:20:54.100
I'll go, too.

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:58.520
Well, thanks for the food.

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:01.150
Sorry for the trouble. You take care.

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:06.910
See you tomorrow, Yunocchi.

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:09.910
It's a bit early, but goodnight.

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:24.010
Oh snap, I didn't clean up the mess.

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:32.760
Done.

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:36.350
I hope I win the Delight of the Hokkai Sea.

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:46.570
I'm so tired.

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:51.740
All kinds of things happened today.

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:57.580
Oh, my fingers are red.
I should put on some hand cream.

00:22:06.300 --> 00:22:08.590
The End of January 11th

00:22:06.880 --> 00:22:08.590
To Be Continued

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:21.270
It eventually fades into the tall sky

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:22.900
The voices

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:27.690
Bubble up and fade away

00:22:28.610 --> 00:22:31.110
Fade away

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:35.790
They return to where they belong

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:44.290
And fuse together as they sparkle and collide

00:22:46.170 --> 00:22:49.800
This body feels like one entity

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:52.970
Yet, it's made of infinity

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:56.350
Caught a falling drop of water

00:22:56.350 --> 00:23:02.350
And now I'm taking a closer look

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:04.980
Awakening Drive

00:23:04.980 --> 00:23:09.440
Dash into the sky in our bare feet

00:23:09.440 --> 00:23:13.660
Close your eyes, can you see it?

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:16.830
It's a rainbow bridge, let's run toward it

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:18.490
Awakening Drive

00:23:18.490 --> 00:23:22.830
A dazzling spark will break a star into pieces

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:31.050
Scattering across the sky and falling,
now in my hands

00:23:31.420 --> 00:23:37.930
I have a piece of a dream, shining so bright

00:23:37.940 --> 00:23:39.480
Next Episode

00:23:39.810 --> 00:23:45.030
I'd like to know why the sky is blue,
and why the summer is hot.

00:23:45.030 --> 00:23:46.360
It's because it's summer.

00:23:46.360 --> 00:23:49.200
Why a babied mint plant gets infested by bugs?

00:23:49.200 --> 00:23:52.660
And you hear a strange singing voice
and creaking of the floor?

00:23:52.660 --> 00:23:53.950
If I start thinking about those things,
I can't sleep.

00:23:53.950 --> 00:23:55.240
If I start thinking about those things,
I can't sleep.

00:23:55.240 --> 00:23:56.160
Oh, that's what you call ''Mystery gives way
to mystery.'' It wouldn't be easy.

00:23:56.160 --> 00:23:58.710
Oh, that's what you call ''Mystery gives way
to mystery.'' It wouldn't be easy.

00:23:58.710 --> 00:24:01.920
Next episode is
''August 21st, Japan's Summer''

00:23:58.710 --> 00:24:07.670
August 21st, Japan's Summer

00:24:02.210 --> 00:24:05.300
We'll be waiting at the Hidamari Apartments,
so please, join us again.
